{"id":"welllog-layer","sceneId":"w1","title":"测井曲线智能分层","status":"ready","version":"1.0.0","updated":"2026-10-22","tabs":{"background":{"label":"专业背景","judge":[{"label":"任务类型","value":"序列分割 / 变点检测","desc":"不是逐点分类，而是找\"位置\"","html":"<span style=\"color:var(--c-ts)\">序列分割</span>"},{"label":"数据门槛","value":"30—50 口井","desc":"需要人工分层表作标签"},{"label":"收益","value":"3.5 h → 15 min","desc":"单井卡层工时（仅复核）","html":"<b style=\"color:var(--jade-d);font-family:var(--mono)\">3.5h → 15min</b>"},{"label":"难度","value":"中","desc":"标签粒度不一致是主要障碍","html":"<span class=\"dtag\" data-d=\"中\">难度 中</span>"}],"lede":"测井曲线是井筒内连续测量的岩石物理响应。分层（卡层）是把一条连续曲线切成地质单元的第一步 —— 后面的储层解释、射孔选段、压裂分段，全都以这套界面为底图。所以它错一点，下游全都要返工。","sections":[{"no":1,"en":"PROBLEM","title":"当前做法与问题","html":"<p>一口井常规三四条曲线、上千米井段。解释员要对照邻井逐段卡层，单井 2—4 小时。<b>薄互层段界线模糊</b>，不同人卡的位置能差 0.5—1 m，而这 1 m 直接决定射孔段和压裂分段的位置。</p><p>更麻烦的是「对错」本身就没有唯一答案：同一口井，两位解释员交上来的层数可能相差两层。这决定了后面所有的评测方式 —— <b>不能用\"逐点准确率\"，只能用\"界面是否落在容差内\"</b>。</p><div class=\"figure\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 620 300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"人工卡层误差示意\"><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"33.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">1000</text><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"76\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"79.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">1060</text><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"125.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">1120</text><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"171.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">1180</text><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"214\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"214\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"217.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">1240</text><line x1=\"96\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#e9e4d8\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"263.5\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"monospace\" fill=\"#9ba3a9\">1300</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"89.80000000000001\" x2=\"358\" y2=\"89.80000000000001\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"135.8\" x2=\"358\" y2=\"135.8\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"172.6\" x2=\"358\" y2=\"172.6\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"191\" x2=\"358\" y2=\"191\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"/><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"237\" x2=\"358\" y2=\"237\" stroke=\"#2f7d6b\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 3\"/><polyline points=\"227.1,30.0 227.9,30.9 222.8,31.8 224.2,32.7 226.5,33.5 227.3,34.4 222.3,35.3 231.6,36.2 228.2,37.1 226.2,38.0 224.7,38.8 230.4,39.7 229.0,40.6 222.3,41.5 227.2,42.4 224.1,43.3 229.2,44.2 223.2,45.0 227.9,45.9 227.1,46.8 223.5,47.7 222.0,48.6 232.3,49.5 232.6,50.3 222.8,51.2 226.6,52.1 232.5,53.0 223.6,53.9 226.3,54.8 227.8,55.7 229.2,56.5 224.7,57.4 223.4,58.3 232.8,59.2 226.6,60.1 224.1,61.0 227.7,61.8 225.2,62.7 223.2,63.6 230.4,64.5 225.5,65.4 225.5,66.3 222.3,67.2 232.1,68.0 224.2,68.9 231.6,69.8 226.9,70.7 224.2,71.6 228.4,72.5 226.1,73.3 230.2,74.2 229.0,75.1 223.0,76.0 224.0,76.9 226.6,77.8 222.5,78.7 222.0,79.5 226.2,80.4 229.3,81.3 228.9,82.2 232.5,83.1 225.2,84.0 226.5,84.8 227.2,85.7 226.5,86.6 231.1,87.5 226.6,88.4 226.5,89.3 157.3,90.2 157.0,91.0 162.8,91.9 155.7,92.8 157.3,93.7 163.1,94.6 164.1,95.5 165.4,96.3 164.9,97.2 164.2,98.1 162.9,99.0 161.6,99.9 160.6,100.8 154.5,101.7 158.0,1